proves the editor by not requiring a restart to change 3d gizmo colors/settings\r\nI've tested each of the related gizmos and all appear to update without issue.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16bd10f1-a6d3-46fd-a6fb-44102cd05054)\r\n\r\n\r\nNotes for the future: \r\n\r\n~~1. The following colors are unused currently:~~ see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101920#issuecomment-2607855898 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101920#issuecomment-2609685156\r\n```\r\neditors/3d_gizmos/gizmo_colors/spring_bone_joint\r\neditors/3d_gizmos/gizmo_colors/spring_bone_collision\r\neditors/3d_gizmos/gizmo_colors/spring_bone_inside_collision\r\neditors/3d_gizmos/gizmo_colors/path\r\neditors/3d_gizmos/gizmo_colors/particles_emission_shape\r\n```\r\n\r\n2.  `editors/3d_gizmos/gizmo_settings/path3d_tilt_disk_size` wasn't able to be changed in a similar way because it instantiates a Path3DGizmo with a specified disk size. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","de